    {
      "id": 137264,
      "name": "MarioFanaticXV",
      "username": "MarioFanaticXV",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mariofanaticxv/{size}/2129_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-13T04:57:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I wonder how they decide the order to release promos in, since it's clearly different from the order they were released for the physical game. Sure, Young Legacy and Rook City Wraith were both early comers, but GI Bunker really surprised me to be seen so early. Super Scientific Tachyon, I can understand, since it was linked to the game's release.<br><br>That being said, I hope Eternal Haka is soon- don't get me wrong, Haka is pretty useful with his base card, but he just becomes an absolute powerhouse with the extra draws to strengthen his namesake abilities.</p>",
      "post_number": 9,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:13:35.939Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
