      "created_at": "2015-03-13T17:55:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There's a video game Knight of the tabletop, where you roleplay a group of role players. Its fun, I like using the bard with the barbarian, shaman mage and necromancer, which allows you to deal ridiculous amounts of damage with everyone but the bard, while restoring mana.</p><p>Back on subject, I realize you aren't following the previous game exactly, but the way I laid it out seems to fit the heroes left.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
