      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-13T18:08:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pydro\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/48/1844_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pydro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>MigrantP wrote:</b><br><blockquote>(Super Scientific Tachyon would have to wait until the video game version of the video game was released)\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nThat is so cool, instead of picking heroes, you pick the people playing the heroes. Who would I pick first...\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'd pick Foote, and make him play Fanatic but never Reedemer Fanatic.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>One of my favorite campaigns my old rpg group ran we rolled characters, then the GM had us play as other people in the group with the characters they rolled. &nbsp;It was a lot of fun.</p>",
