      "raw": "[quote=\"Pydro\"]\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>MigrantP wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">(Super Scientific Tachyon would have to wait until the video game version of the video game was released)\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nThat is so cool, instead of picking heroes, you pick the people playing the heroes. Who would I pick first...\n\n[/quote]\n\nI&#39;d pick Foote, and make him play Fanatic but never Reedemer Fanatic.&nbsp;\n\nOne of my favorite campaigns my old rpg group ran we rolled characters, then the GM had us play as other people in the group with the characters they rolled. &nbsp;It was a lot of fun.\n",
